    "description": "<section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block scrpg-archetype-block-intro\"><p>A supernatural curse has been inflicted upon you or your family line, granting both boons and banes.</p></section><section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block\"><div class=\"scrpg-archetype-section\">Powers</div><p>Assign all the dice you rolled at the end of the background step to any of the following powers:</p><p>• @UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.powers.Item.fubw8CJu2mXFZJUD]{Signature Weaponry}</p><p>• Select from Athletic powers category</p><p>• Select from Elemental/Energy powers category</p><p>• Select from Materials powers category</p><p>• Select from Self Control powers category</p></section><section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block\"><div class=\"scrpg-archetype-section\">Abilities</div><p>Gain two of these Yellow abilities, each using a different power:</p><ul class=\"scrpg-archetype-ability-links\"><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.IDh8jA5NA1CqIuO7]{Attunement}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.YgPROkkBBWLLCg95]{Costly Strength}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.K8RnyLm4CsGUsG6X]{Cursed Resolve}</li></ul><p>Gain one of these Green abilities:</p><ul class=\"scrpg-archetype-ability-links\"><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.jlGY2E8QM3GHmW38]{Double Edged Luck}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.5OqV73nGVJbqFFLB]{Extremes}</li></ul></section><section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block\"><div class=\"scrpg-archetype-section\">Archetype</div><p>Roll d12, d6 for archetype selection.</p></section>"
